<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">A reading method · the negative space of a text, made usable</div>
    <h1>Summary Plus</h1>
    <p class="lede">A summary relays. Read the negative space, and it starts doing what a <em>close reader</em> does. Paste this beside anything you want summarized, and ask for a summary that reads what the source implies but never states.</p>

    <div class="paste">
