        <span class="url">https://eigentrace.ai/summary-plus</span>
      </div>
      <button class="copybtn" id="copy">Copy URL</button>
      <p class="paste-note">Then ask for a summary that uses the method. This page describes a way of reading — what to look for, and the discipline that keeps it honest — precisely enough to apply to whatever is in front of it. Nothing to install. The page is the description; the reading does the work.</p>
